{
  "info": {
    "name": "QR-Assistance API",
    "_postman_id": "qr-assistance-collection-v1",
    "description": "Colección completa del Sistema de Control de Asistencia Académica.\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Crear un entorno en Postman con la variable `baseUrl` = `http://localhost:3000`\n2. Ejecutar **Auth > Login** con el rol deseado\n3. El script de login guarda automáticamente el token en la variable `authToken`\n4. Todos los demás requests usan `{{authToken}}` en el header Authorization",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3000" },
    { "key": "authToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "careerId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "periodId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "subjectId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "groupId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "gsId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "studentId", "value": "2" },
    { "key": "sessionId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "attendanceId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "justificationId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "notificationId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "qrToken", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Usa POST /api/auth/token para obtener un Bearer JWT directamente. El script de test guarda el token en {{authToken}} automáticamente.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": " Login Admin → guarda token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.success && res.data && res.data.token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('authToken', res.data.token);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('currentUserId', String(res.data.user.id));",
                  "  console.log(' Token guardado. Rol:', res.data.user.role);",
                  "  pm.test('Login exitoso', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "} else {",
                  "  pm.test('Login fallido', () => { throw new Error(res.message); });",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@itcelaya.edu.mx\",\n  \"password\": \"password\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/token", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "token"] },
            "description": "Devuelve un JWT con expiración de 7 días. El token se guarda en {{authToken}} y se usa automáticamente en todos los demás requests."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "🔑 Login Teacher → guarda token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.success && res.data && res.data.token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('authToken', res.data.token);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('currentUserId', String(res.data.user.id));",
                  "  console.log(' Token guardado. Rol:', res.data.user.role);",
                  "  pm.test('Login exitoso', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"teacher@itcelaya.edu.mx\",\n  \"password\": \"password\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/token", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "token"] },
            "description": "Cambia a sesión de docente. Crea este usuario en la DB primero (role=teacher)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "🔑 Login Student → guarda token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.success && res.data && res.data.token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('authToken', res.data.token);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('currentUserId', String(res.data.user.id));",
                  "  console.log(' Token guardado. Rol:', res.data.user.role);",
                  "  pm.test('Login exitoso', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"student@itcelaya.edu.mx\",\n  \"password\": \"password\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/token", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "token"] },
            "description": "Cambia a sesión de alumno. Crea este usuario en la DB primero (role=student)."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
